Package: gfplot
Type: Package
Title: Publication-Ready Figures for Cancer Bioinformatics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Feng", "Gao", email = "gaofeng21cn@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A compact plotting toolkit for cancer bioinformatics figures.
    Provides publication-ready Kaplan-Meier curves with hazard ratios, ROC
    and time-dependent ROC curves, multiple-ROC comparisons, risk-score
    distributions, PCA and UMAP projections, boxplots and correlation plots,
    lasso coefficient paths, enrichment plots, and immune-infiltration
    radar charts. Palette helpers return colour-blind-friendly colours in
    journal styles.
